{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">解放軍南部戰區在黃岩島一帶展開戰備警巡。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.PATROL-1500.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Il6WGpO9cz1788334557.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.PATROL-1500.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">南部戰區表示，周三組織海空兵力，在黃岩島領海領空及周邊區域展開戰備警巡。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.PATROL-1500_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026HrbOQXUPtk1788334563.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.PATROL-1500_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黃岩島是中國固有領土，8月份以來，戰區部隊持續加強黃岩島領海周邊海空域巡邏警戒，進一步強化有關海空域管控力度，有力有效應對各類侵權挑釁行徑，堅決捍衛國家主權安全，堅定維護南海地區和平穩定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T08:04:05.630118+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}